      "writtenOn": "2024-07-31T14:05:00Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes but its still the same semantic meaning of `offset` throughout all the gradient code. If `offset` is a confusing term I feel that should be refactored throughout all the gradient code and not just here.",
