      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-07-30T20:00:13Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I agree its easier to follow from `0` to `numStops - 1`, however there is a measurable improvement of 1-2% by keeping it this way since we can eliminate integer addition in each loop iteration.",
