      "writtenOn": "2024-07-31T12:34:27Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I agree with Nathan\u0027s plan. `offset` is overloaded but the rest of the gradient code uses that terminology for the location of the color stop. Changing `bufferOffset` alleviates the overloading so that makes sense to me.",
      "parentUuid": "c454e264_e27aa013",
      "range": {
